&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>BBHash represents a minimal perfect hash for a set of keys.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Parameters&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="parameters">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#parameters" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>compute_reverse_map&lt;/strong> (&lt;code>Bool&lt;/code>): If True, compute the reverse_map which allows looking up the original
key based off an index.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Fields&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="fields">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#fields" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>bits&lt;/strong> (&lt;code>List[BitVec]&lt;/code>)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>ranks&lt;/strong> (&lt;code>List[UInt64]&lt;/code>)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>reverse_map&lt;/strong> (&lt;code>List[UInt64]&lt;/code>)&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Implemented traits&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="implemented-traits">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#implemented-traits" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;code>AnyType&lt;/code>, &lt;code>Deinitable&lt;/code>, &lt;code>Movable&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
